     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A percent is a specific rational number and is literally per 100. <span data-math=\"n\"></span> percent, denoted <span data-math=\"n\\% \"></span>, is the fraction <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{{100}}.\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"4\\%  = \\frac{4}{{100}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Alternate correct answer: <span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{{25}}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\frac{4}{{100}}\">\\frac{4}{{100}}</span>\n"
